# Memory Bank first

Before non-trivial work in this repo, read:

- `memory-bank/productBrief.md`
- `memory-bank/techContext.md`
- `memory-bank/systemPatterns.md` (wins over vague prompts)
- `memory-bank/roadmap.md`
- `memory-bank/agent-rules/agent.md`
- relevant `memory-bank/tasks/`

This app is the **Expo client** for CricLab bowling analysis. The Python lab is
`Cric-Lab/criclab-web-backend`. Do not port MediaPipe, OpenCV, Gemma, or PDF
generation here. Display the lab’s metrics JSON honestly (`metricReady` /
`status === ok`). Bowling only. Two film modes stay separate. No radar-gun claims.
